    "viewsWelcome": [
      {
        "view": "playwrightBddRunner.traceability",
        "when": "!playwrightBddRunner.traceability.connected",
        "contents": "Set up Xray integration to map your scenarios to Xray tests, see coverage at a glance, and publish run results back to Jira.\n\n[Set up Xray](command:playwrightBddRunner.traceability.connect)\n\nPrefer to keep this out of the way? [Hide this panel](command:playwrightBddRunner.traceability.hidePanel)."
      },
      {
        "view": "playwrightBddRunner.traceability",
        "when": "playwrightBddRunner.traceability.connected",
        "contents": "No Xray-tagged scenarios found yet.\n\nTag a scenario with `@TEST_KEY` (and optionally `@REQ_KEY`) in a .feature file to map it to an Xray test. The tree then groups scenarios by their Xray keys, lists untagged scenarios as coverage gaps, and shows pass/fail badges after a run.\n\nSync loads the remote test catalog, the Coverage Board links scenarios to Xray tests, and publishing sends run results back to Jira."
      }
    ],
